{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12653","headline":"系乐府十二首 去乡悲 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 去乡悲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"踌蹰古塞关，悲歌爲谁长。\n日行见孤老，羸弱相提将。\n闻其呼怨声，闻声问其方。\n方言无患苦，岂弃父母乡。\n非不见其心，仁惠诚所望。\n念之何可说，独立爲凄伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}